nu, pa je takva i Lekcija. Razlozi le\u017ee u mnogostranosti sorte. Muskatne arome, prijatne i sve\u017ee kiseline, vo\u0107ne i cvetne note, blagi za\u010dinski nagove\u0161taji, sve to mo\u017ee na\u0107i svoje mesto tokom celog obeda \u2013 od predjela, do dezerta. Naravno, kao i kod drugih sorti vrlo je va\u017ena dobra temperatura slu\u017eenja, ali je mo\u017eda kod tamjanike to najva\u017enije. Ipak, ako treba definisati u\u017ei izbor hrane uz tamjaniku, onda bi to svakako bila perad (divlja ili doma\u0107a), pripremljena uz kremaste bele sosove.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"130000","regular_price":"130000","sale_price":"130000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"RSD","currency_symbol":"\u0440\u0441\u0434","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u0440\u0441\u0434"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,300.00&nbsp;<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#1088;&#1089;&#1076;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":256,"src":"https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-300x450.png","srcset":"https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija.png 800w, https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-200x300.png 200w, https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-683x1024.png 683w, https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-768x1152.png 768w, https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-300x450.png 300w, https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic-lekcija-600x900.png 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/vinarijaspasic.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/spasic